OL,3,GNEWSAMLAs to get #2,000 pay rise from
OL,4,AMay
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Assembly members
OL,7,F(MLAs) are set to receive a more than
OL,8,F#2,000 pay rise next year, bringing
OL,9,Ftheir annual salary to #69,216.
OL,11,FThe increase will take effect from the
OL,12,Ffirst sitting day of the new assembly
OL,13,Fmandate next May, under draft proposals
OL,14,Fby Stormont's Independent Remuneration
OL,15,FBoard.
OL,17,FThe proposals follow MLAs being awarded
OL,18,Fan almost 27% uplift in their annual
OL,19,Fwages in April - a rise more than
OL,20,F#14,000.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
