OL,3,GNEWSAMLAs to get #2,000 pay rise from
OL,4,AMay
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlan Lowry, chair of the board, said
OL,7,Fthat was a "corrective measure" after
OL,8,Fyears of no substantial rises - but
OL,9,Ffuture increases would be expected to
OL,10,F"reflect inflationary and other pay
OL,11,Ftrends".
